WEBVTT

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.350
Look at how high-cut her swimsuit is!

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:09.840
Yeah.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.350
She's wearing a string bikini!

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:11.960
Right.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.380
She'd be perfect if her breasts were a bit larger! So close!

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.820
That's true.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.010
I wonder if Katsura-san will be here soon.
She'll be amazing without many clothes on.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.140
What's wrong? Stomachache?

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.380
No... I was just thinking about what I should do now.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.370
I'm just talking to myself.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.420
You do your best.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.100
Girls' Dressing Room

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.080
I knew it, but...

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.400
Even if I look closely, they just don't get smaller, do they?

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.870
It's embarrassing.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.400
No, I think you should be pretty proud...

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.320
What are you doing?

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.260
N-No, it's not like that!

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.140
Like that?

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.210
Squeeze. Squeeze. Squeeze. Squeeze. Squeeze. Squeeze.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:22.270
How are they? Nanami let me borrow them.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.040
I'm good.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.490
I don't want to use something like this.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:31.050
Yeah, you're fine the way you are.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:12.580
Since we've made up, do you want to go to a water park this Sunday?

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.060
Good morning!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.030
M-Morning...

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:23.480
You don't look that cheerful. Your blood pressure must be low.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.200
You're just too cheerful.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.070
Oh, tickets!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:30.490
So you've already heard about the water park? You must have gotten them from Hikari.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.310
Huh?

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.450
What? Am I wrong?

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:35.550
I got these from Kotonoha yesterday...

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.420
Good morning!

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:37.960
Kuroda?

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.460
What's up, Hikari?

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.150
Th-These are, Itou...

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.410
Well...

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.390
What?! You're interested in me, too?!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:50.820
Stupid.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.990
Dumbass!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.700
That's not it.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.140
Could you, uh,

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:01.800
invite Sawanaga with these?

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.250
You mean Taisuke?! Why?!

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:07.850
Why?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.400
You're really stupid.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:13.380
Complementary Ticket

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.620
Who would have thought it'd be on the same day?

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:20.470
Well, I didn't really feel like going alone with Kotonoha, so I guess she helped me out...

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.360
And to think Kuroda likes Taisuke of all people...

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.840
I didn't think you'd invite me to a water park.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:33.610
I got a lot of tickets, and something like this is a lot more fun when everyone goes together, right?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:40.300
Aw, you're thinking of your friends. Lately it feels like you've been getting all the attention.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.400
Don't cry.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.630
I can't help it when I think seeing Katsura in her swimsuit up close.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.840
You're after Kotonoha?! I mean Katsura?!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.990
She looks like a model! It's criminal!

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.550
I want to be close to her!

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.640
I-I see.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.230
Within limits, hopefully.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.980
I can't help but question Kuroda's taste in guys.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.030
Everyone's taking so long.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.740
It takes time for girls to get ready.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:09.000
You're wonderful for being able to say something like that so matter-of-fact, and I hate you for it!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.120
Right.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.500
Sorry for the wait.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.570
You took too long.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.230
Sawanaga, you have a pretty perverted look on your face.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.470
They're not wearing their school swimsuits. I'm touched.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.440
Of course they're not.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:40.050
No, school swimsuits are good in their own right, but these are stimulating in their own way!

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:42.950
I got it. Don't say anymore.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.770
You like that?

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.140
Sorry that more people joined us.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.380
It's okay, don't worry about it.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:56.130
Saionji-san is a friend, and everyone else is fun.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.900
If you say so.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:02.440
Besides, I still get to be with you.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:11.640
Uh, this is because Kotonoha said she can't swim, so I promised I would coach her.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.480
That's right.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.030
I'm jealous!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:19.040
Both of you have perverted looks on your faces!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.430
Perverted.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:22.280
That's harsh.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:24.090
Go on.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:25.920
Right.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.810
Hey, Sawanaga.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:34.850
I, um, don't know how to swim either.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:38.040
Could you teach me?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.190
Sure.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.410
That was fast.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.060
Get a bit more excited about it!

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:43.650
About what?

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:47.220
I-It doesn't matter! Let's go!

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.890
Hey!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.400
Taisuke might be hopeless.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.740
I feel bad for Hikari.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.270
Yeah.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.320
I-I guess so.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:05.280
Swim swim swim swim swim swim.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:14.050
Saionji-san's amazing.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:17.010
Maybe it'd be better if she taught you.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.000
I'm fine with you!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.770
I-I see.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.750
Okay, I'll pull your arms, then.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.450
Don't let go, okay?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.650
It'll be fine.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:27.750
Here.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:55.910
Y-Yeah, like that.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.650
Right!

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:07.060
Hold on tight.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:08.800
Okay.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.100
Tighter.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.080
Okay.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.960
Yahoo!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.140
Sawanaga, you're helpless.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:35.530
Wasn't I supposed to be teaching you how to sw-?!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.520
After you've gone down the water slide, move out of the way.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.430
That was on purpose, wasn't it?!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.020
One more time.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:47.470
Is the class president really like that?

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:49.560
That's right. She's like that.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.300
Girls are a mystery.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.880
Well, they're not that open with guys.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.900
That's good to know.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.320
Anyway, why don't we go again, too?

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.090
I didn't know you were like this either.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:05.300
Well, I am!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.060
Sekai...

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.310
Where's Katsura-san?

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:19.340
She told me she'd be back.

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:22.100
Oh, the ladies room.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.050
Looks like things are going well.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:25.420
I wonder.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.830
You were holding each other.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.140
You saw that?!

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:32.080
