00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.880
That was because Kotonoha can't swim!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.980
Makoto's gotten aggressive.

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:39.590
I wonder if that's due to my training.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.900
What are you blushing for?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:48.230
Does that mean I'm good at what we were practicing?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.380
S-Stupid! What are you saying?!

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:53.920
I might need to practice more.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.170
Huh? It's obvious what you're after.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:10:00.500
We were just practicing. Nothing more, nothing less.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.970
What's that about?

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.780
Don't misunderstand!

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:06.160
I'm not!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.480
That's good, then.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:14.820
What?

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.900
You look good in your swimsuit.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.240
I bought a new one this year.

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:23.060
I spent three hours going through them, so of course it'd look good.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.970
It has a nice Sekai feel to it.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.350
What's a Sekai feel?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.880
Bursting with energy?

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.670
What's that about?

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:36.090
I'm sorry I don't have as nice of a body as Katsura-san.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.570
Why are you talking about Kotonoha all of a sudden?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.850
How should I know, dummy?

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:43.050
I-It's okay, yours are fair-sized, too.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.280
What do you mean fair-sized?

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.780
Um, they fit well in your hands?

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.500
Pervert! You're not helping your case at all!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.280
Maybe they'll get larger if I massage them?

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.360
You're the worst!

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:53.600
Pervert! Lecher!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.980
You sure say what's on your mind...

00:10:55.980 --> 00:11:01.390
Whatever. You really are dumb.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.370
What's up?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:16.480
It's kind of nice to spend time joking around with you like this...

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.950
I think I-

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:18.660
No!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.480
Sekai...

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.500
You're dating Katsura-san, right?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.150
See? She's back.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:29.270
Spend time with her.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.570
R-Right...

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:33.480
How about we all eat together?

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.790
Wow! Did you make all of this?

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.930
Yes, there's plenty.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.320
This is great!

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:52.460
So it's good?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:55.150
I'm happy just eating something a girl made!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.090
You eat some more, too, Makoto!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.320
Yes, there's plenty left.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.560
Oh, I'm already full.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.080
It's okay, I can get it myself.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.840
She makes a good girlfriend.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:13.470
Huh?

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.330
What's wrong?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:18.230
I thought you were dating Saionji?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.850
Was I wrong?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:21.860
Uh, well...

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:22.860
Yes.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:26.250
Makoto-kun and I are dating.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:34.910
Oh, that's how it was? Why am I crying?

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.260
Damn it!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.510
Stupid.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.500
Kotonoha, you've gotten better.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.320
Yeah.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.780
I think you'll be fine now.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.020
Really?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:19.620
Then could you take me somewhere a bit deeper, Makoto-kun?

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.670
Hold on to me tight, okay?

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.620
O-Okay...

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.260
Goodbye, my youth.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:34.690
Itou's getting embarrassed. I don't like guys who look embarrassed.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.090
Saionji, you knew about this?

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:43.050
Yeah, I'm the one who played matchmaker and got them together in the first place.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.300
But I thought you liked Itou?

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.570
Did it look like we were getting along that well?

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:49.920
Yeah.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:53.850
It's not about looking like anything. You've been with him all the time recently.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.790
Oh, I've been helping him out.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:02.580
Makoto- I mean Itou... He's pretty dense, so I guess I kind of got into it.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.250
You should worry about making yourself happy first.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.260
Okay!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.290
Oh, Saionji!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.760
Find someone for me next!

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:13.860
In that case...

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:14.850
Wai-!

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:18.090
Okay, I'll figure something out.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.380
Really?!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.570
You're the best, Saionji Sekai-sama!

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:23.120
I'll be climbing the stairway to adulthood soon!

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:26.860
I'm gonna do it! Go me! I'll be climbing it!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.850
Awesome!

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.760
I don't like it when guys look like that.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.100
Hey, Katsura-san!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.480
Makoto-kun, you're here early.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.910
Where's everyone else?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.460
They'll probably be here after they finish drying their hair.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:55.210
You look like you'd take the longest, though.

00:14:55.210 --> 00:15:00.180
Well, that's true, but I didn't want to make you wait.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:04.340
Um, do you think you'll have some free time next Sunday?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.530
Not sure...

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.050
Well, Kokoro wanted to...

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.040
Kokoro-chan?

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:13.690
Yeah, she was asking if she could see you again.

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:14.900
Oh.

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.690
Well, if it's okay with you...

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.770
Y-Yeah...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:22.170
Huh? You don't look too happy.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:23.450
That's not-!

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.180
Is that true, Makoto-kun?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.460
No, I'm happy.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:27.500
Oh, Sekai.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.110
Oh, are we intruding?

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.750
Stupid, what took you so long?

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.010
Makoto!

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:36.890
What?

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:37.740
Come with me for a second!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.810
Katsura-san, I'm going to borrow him for just a minute.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.630
Okay...

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:44.570
Wai-!

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:49.080
You know, everyone's trying to help you two out, so get your act together!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.630
By everyone, you mean Kiyoura and Kuroda?

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.820
Right. They said you guys made a good couple.

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:56.320
I didn't ask them to do that.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:16:00.350
You did all that practicing to get used to girls, so why are you saying all of this now?

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.180
Well, I did, but...

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:03.490
So what?

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:06.530
Sekai, you already know, right?

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:07.560
Know what?

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.950
You know...

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.590
No, I don't!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.080
Sekai?

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:21.640
Did you take what we did during all that training seriously?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:29.150
Jeez, you're so simpleminded.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:32.710
Doesn't matter who it is, as long as they let you touch them, huh? You're such a pervert!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:33.830
No!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:37.400
We can't.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.640
No...

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.650
You're Katsura-san's boyfriend.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.110
No!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.310
I'm not...

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:54.320
We're friends. Nothing more, nothing less.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.810
Sekai...

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.770
Just...forget about it.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.570
Let's go!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.480
Itou, thanks for today.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.810
No problem. Did you tell him you like him yet?

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:46.270
Stupid! Those things take time.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:47.640
Really?

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.800
Yes, really.

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.070
Anyway, see you later.

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:52.960
Katsura-san, you too.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.140
Yeah, I had fun, too.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.390
I have to go.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:03.230
The train'll be here soon.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.110
You're right...

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:07.020
I'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.380
Yeah, see you.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:26.340
The train is about to arrive.
Please wait behind the line.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.990
Haramihama. Haramihama.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:35.800
Just...forget about it.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:41.420
Just...forget about it.

